An unary operation is a function that acts from a set to itself.

type unaryOperation f
  qualifier (A) (on A)
  name (unary operation)
  definition (function t0 t1 t1)

theorem Alternative Definition for Unary Operation on a Set
termVariables(f 0, A 0)
conclusion ↔ unaryOperation t0 t1 function t0 t1 t1
